  "visualBrief": "The red convent and corner-pinnacled clock tower stand beside the ochre palace and its lead-colored dome. An open stone gate leads toward twin gilded cupolas above the tiled portal. The vaulted passage links the entrance side with a paved terrace and an open domed lookout.",
